  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "The Scene class acts as the root controller for a 3D environment, managing all SceneEntity instances, the rendering pipeline, and the lifecycle (update/draw). It encapsulates world state, including clearColor and sceneFog, and provides extensive querying methods for entities based on tags, types, or names. It handles serialization/deserialization to persist the entire scene state, managing resource handles to prevent premature release."
  },
